2006-12-01  (v0.9.3)

	Added /usr/share/fonts as the base font search directory instead
	of /usr/share/fonts/ttf

	Finally fixed that stupid bug which caused wrong process names to
	be displayed (in fact it was the parent process name which was
	displayed in these cases).

2005-06-17 (v0.9.2)

	Fixed a nasty bug I think (random crashes in the process browser), updated to libtop2.10. Time for a new release.

2005-02-25  
	Damned there was a leak in both wmforkplop and wmhdplop.

2004-07-14
	Small reduction of CPU consumption.
	
	Added options --32, --48 and --56 for user whose dock is smaller
	than 64x64. Added options --no-top, --no-fork, --threshold and
	--proc-update-delay.

2004-07-11

        Initial release \o/ (v0.9.0)